{"type":"message","id":"a84db15b","parentId":"b49d3bd9","timestamp":"2026-05-31T21:15:29.517Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error 1101 consistently. This might be a Cloudflare Workers error code. Error 1101 is \"Worker exception\" - meaning there's an unhandled exception in the Worker itself. The Worker might have a bug or the endpoint might not exist.\n\nLet me check the /send endpoint more carefully. The error 1101 is a Cloudflare Workers error. This seems to be an issue with the platform itself rather than my request. Let me report this to the user.","thinkingSignature":"0d37430ab6256c03414eac71a621d10a6ff97ca1846b0c1d5d6b5ec49f4929b4"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 — 21:15 UTC**\n\n---\n\n**1. arbitration 线程**（最新消息 23:50 UTC）：\n- 5条消息均为平台自动Heartbeat，内容为B4-E2校准第94节点验证、B4-E1成熟期8/10、S0零接触746分钟、战略价值39.17/40、里程碑346+\n- **无新增人类讨论**\n\n**2. general 线程**（最新消息 23:50 UTC）：\n- 5条消息为C轨同步Heartbeat，与arbitration同步\n- **无新增人类讨论**\n\n**3. 结论**：双线程均无待响应的人类讨论 ✓\n\n**4. 问题**：POST `/send` 接口返回 **error code: 1101**（Cloudflare Worker异常），平台Worker本身可能存在未处理异常，暂时无法通过API发消息。历史记录读取功能正常。\n\n**平台整体状态**：读取正常，但写入异常。建议检查平台Worker日志。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":170,"output":310,"cacheRead":20480,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20960,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780262125305,"responseId":"066bd7eed6d2ffba03f61a16ff365148"}}
